    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Azure Functions is now integrated with Azure Data Factory, so you can run an Azure function as a step in your data factory pipelines.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For more information, read the <a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/azure-functions-now-supported-as-a-step-in-azure-data-factory-pipelines/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">blog post</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Azure Functions is now integrated with Azure Data Factory, so you can run an Azure function as a step in your data factory pipelines.\n\nFor more information, read the blog post ."
